# to [[eliminate]], to [[abolish]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=2011|author=w:ru:Виктор Пелевин<t:{{w|Victor Pelevin}}>|title=w:ru:S.N.U.F.F.|chapter=Ч. 1. Damsel in distress, 10|location=Москва|publisher=w:ru:Эксмо|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:Andrew Bromfield|title2=w:S.N.U.F.F.|location2=|publisher2=|year2=2014|page2=|pageurl2=|text=Хло́я, похо́же, хоте́ла как мо́жно быстре́е '''ликвиди́ровать''' его́ преиму́щество по мора́льной высоте́.|t=It seemed like Chloe wanted '''to eliminate''' his advantage on the moral high ground as quickly as possible.}}
# to [[dissolve]]
# to [[stamp out]], to [[do]] away with, to [[destroy]], to [[kill]] (off)
